#~ msgid ""
#~ "NOTE: If you are hosting your site on WPEngine or a provider which "
#~ "performs server caching, you will need to ask the host support people to "
#~ "NOT cache your renamed login page."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ПРИМЕЧАНИЕ: Если вы размещаете свой сайт на WPEngine или у провайдера, "
